# Preserve user theme changes

The merchant/developer also edits this Shopify theme directly. Do not remove, revert, or overwrite their work.

- Before editing a file, read the current contents first. Treat existing code as intentional.
- Change only the lines needed for the requested task. Do not rewrite a whole file unless asked.
- If a user edit conflicts with a planned change, keep the user's code and adapt around it. Ask before replacing it.
- Do not "clean up" unrelated markup, CSS, comments, attributes, or formatting the user added.
- Do not restore files to an earlier conversation version if the user has edited them since.
